  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThe parallel queue example in the [Parallelism section](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#starting-a-new-parallel-queue) in HTML resolves/rejects a promise in parallel (or as part of a parallel queue) without first queuing a task: see steps 2.1 and 2.4 in both the \"incorrect\" and \"correct\" versions of the algorithm.\r\n\r\nVia https://github.com/w3c/strudy/issues/663 where I've started to look into automating detection of such hiccups in specs (although not in examples)",
